@startuml
title PlantUML MCP Architecture

actor Client

node "Docker MCP Gateway" as GW

package "Single Docker Container" {
  component "Java MCP Server\n(stdio)" as MCP
  component "PlantUML core\n(plantuml-mit, in-process)" as PUML
  component "Graphviz dot\n(EPL-1.0, external process)" as DOT
}

Client --> GW : Streamable HTTP
GW --> MCP : stdio
MCP --> PUML : PlantUML core API
PUML --> DOT : subprocess\n(diagram layout)
PUML --> MCP : SVG / PNG
MCP --> GW
GW --> Client

@enduml
